" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L372" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "MeasureLongest" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "当前候选里最长的那个名字有多宽（按名字缓存…" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L392" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#F8FAFC', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "ComputeWidth" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "宽度 = 最长候选 + 图标 + 内边距 …" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L414" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "PlaceAt" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "贴着光标显示。(x, top, botto…" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L430" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#F8FAFC', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "ResetPlacement" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "新一次弹窗重新计算位置，别沿用上次的坐标" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L485" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E